<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained a 2,000‑liter mineral oil leak from a submarine cable off Tabango, Leyte, and rescued 29 passengers and crew from a distressed boat in Palawan while suspending sea travel there because of rough seas. The Armed Forces of the Philippines spokesperson reiterated that the Philippines is merely standing up for its rights in the West Philippine Sea. China Coast Guard continued patrolling waters around Diaoyu Dao and a Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador over threatening remarks. UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cebu Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPeEg0am1fbjhMYm41aWJiUGF4dVRtSEFqWkNtTjVvdWY1cy1iS215RUprY3ZNeVpuN2c0X29SbnVLTWpXVU9XYkxxVW43anhGb0lkdTVLU0huUWRMWnVfNlVsMlUwejJ2bnZMZEFBWTF3eEhOekdaUXhRQW5HU0dqOHdQNEgyMUlpejhTdFdUZTNQaTFsV2tIUDQ2a0ROUmE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;DVIDS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNR2hleDdydllBaERrQmc5cUNtNG9zeEFUejh4M3BMX0tjckFtcjU4c2lNMjdKbVJVYkxFYnRLVzM0V2VFS21xWlJ5ZDFIRlFYSUtqTjFtZG9oZzZYbC1MaUhUM280M3VIbUV2RV84WHB4NnoxakNndlg0OEFLMkltYTZKaTFxQ3hBQmg4NEpRY0xYVGVHRVRiVmtEX2NnSTh2UEJSb20xM2t5cWdkaTN5QzM5LXgyMmM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go